WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
The operating model needs
named owners at every handoff.

00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:08.080
Domain testers define expected
behavior and review AI proposals.

00:00:08.131 --> 00:00:10.640
Automation engineers maintain
the executable checks.

00:00:10.747 --> 00:00:14.080
Platform owners support environments,
fixtures and evidence.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.360
Product and release owners
retain business decisions.

00:00:17.568 --> 00:00:22.400
Pairing and review can help manual
testers develop new skills without losing

00:00:22.413 --> 00:00:27.120
their domain expertise. Agree
overlap windows, supplier incentives

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:31.920
and ownership of reusable assets before
expanding beyond the pilot squad.
